{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `y`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: reordered the model block so each parameter receives its unique built-in prior before it is used in the derived coefficient calculation or likelihood. The local `beta` calculation is placed in a nested block after the priors. No data changes were required; `data_safe.json` is the supplied data unchanged.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=1> N; // Number of data
  int<lower=1> M; // Number of covariates
  matrix[M, N] X;
  array[N] real y;
}

parameters {
  vector[M] beta_tilde;
  vector<lower=0>[M] lambda;
  real<lower=0> tau_tilde;
  real alpha;
  real<lower=0> sigma;
}

model {
  beta_tilde ~ normal(0, 1);
  lambda ~ cauchy(0, 1);
  tau_tilde ~ cauchy(0, 1);

  alpha ~ normal(0, 2);
  sigma ~ normal(0, 2);

  {
    // tau ~ cauchy(0, sigma)
    // beta ~ normal(0, tau * lambda)
    vector[M] beta = beta_tilde .* lambda * sigma * tau_tilde;

    y ~ normal(X' * beta + alpha, sigma);
  }
}
","data_safe_json":"{"M":1,"N":4,"X":[[4.208767332384621,5.6530697974134805,3.518634550133586,5.166755245084225]],"y":[4.0,4.0,4.0,4.0]}","protected_variables":["y"]}
